 "已复制当前完整独立Base R脚本": "Copied the complete standalone base R script",
 "AIC逐步选择": "AIC stepwise selection",
 "Ridge / Lasso与λ选择": "Ridge / Lasso and λ selection",
 "同一测试集四模型比较": "Four models on one test set",
 "同一个确认样本、同一训练/测试区间。Ridge复杂度是包含截距的有效自由度，其余为解释变量数；定义不同不可直接等同。只说明当前划分误差，不据此挑选再宣称独立验证。": "Same confirmed sample, same training and test window. Ridge complexity is the effective degrees of freedom including the intercept; the others count explanatory variables, so the definitions are not directly comparable. This only describes the error on the current split and must not be used to re-select a model and then claim independent validation.",
 "训练拟合最好，预测新数据也一定最好吗？": "Does the best training fit also predict new data best?",
 "测试MAE": "Test MAE",
 "共同训练 / 测试": "Shared train / test",
 "有效模型": "Valid models",
 "同一测试集 · 四模型误差比较": "One test set · four-model error comparison",
 "测试RMSE（%）": "Test RMSE (%)",
 "模型": "Model",
 "训练RMSE": "Train RMSE",
 "复杂度": "Complexity",
 "OLS/Stepwise复杂度=可估计斜率数；Ridge=有效自由度（含截距）；Lasso=活跃斜率数。Ridge/Lasso只用训练内部时间验证选λ；Stepwise仅训练选择。测试目标日期均在训练之后。反复看测试结果再改模型，会削弱独立评价意义。": "OLS/Stepwise complexity is the number of estimable slopes; Ridge is the effective degrees of freedom (intercept included); Lasso is the number of active slopes. Ridge/Lasso pick λ by time-series validation inside the training window only; Stepwise selects on training data only. All test target dates fall after training. Repeatedly tuning against the test results weakens the meaning of independent evaluation.",
 "请先选择CSV 当前确认样本未替换。": "Please choose a CSV first. The current confirmed sample was not replaced.",
 "复制完整脚本到干净R Script，全选运行。仅需Base R。当前收益已内嵌，日期已配对，脚本含全部函数、参数和输出。网页不执行R。": "Copy the full script into a clean R Script and run all of it. Base R only. Current returns are embedded and dates are already paired; the script contains every function, parameter and output. The page does not execute R.",
 "关闭详情": "Close details",
 "双资产CCC": "Two-asset CCC",
 "双资产风险图": "Two-asset risk chart",
 "两阶段：分别GARCH拟合，再用相同日期标准化残差相关构造H=D R D。不是联合极大似然；相关常数，不是DCC。": "Two stages: fit each series with GARCH, then build H=D R D from the correlation of standardised residuals on shared dates. This is not joint maximum likelihood; the correlation is constant, so it is not DCC.",
 "两种资产同时波动，如何描述它们的共同风险？": "When two assets move together, how should their joint risk be described?",
