 "# [delta] 带连续股息的 BS 价格、Delta；到期直接使用支付函数": "# [delta] BS price and Delta with a continuous dividend; at expiry the payoff function is used directly",
 "# [dividend] 左端点矩形近似，股息期末入账；空头为支出，不额外复利": "# [dividend] left-endpoint rectangle approximation; dividends are booked at period end; shorts pay them, with no extra compounding",
 "# [initial] 权利金支付股票成本，余款为现金；允许负现金（借款）": "# [initial] the premium pays for the shares and the remainder is cash; negative cash (borrowing) is allowed",
 "# [interest] 先按连续复利更新现金账户，负现金承担利息": "# [interest] update the cash account first at continuously compounded interest; negative cash pays interest",
 "# [net] 卖方组合：股票+现金-期权负债；终点price为真实支付": "# [net] short-side portfolio: shares + cash - option liability; the terminal price is the true payoff",
 "# [parameters] 定价与路径波动率一致；允许卖空、分数持仓，无交易成本": "# [parameters] pricing and path volatility agree; short selling and fractional positions are allowed, with no transaction costs",
 "# [path] Park-Miller + Box-Muller，与网页相同的可复现教学随机数": "# [path] Park-Miller + Box-Muller, the same reproducible teaching random numbers as the web page",
 "# [plot] 相同路径上的三策略；单条路径误差不保证随调仓频率单调改善": "# [plot] three strategies on one path; single-path error is not guaranteed to improve monotonically with rebalancing frequency",
 "# [settle] 终点表格为清算前账户；卖出所有股票并支付期权后，现金等于净误差": "# [settle] the terminal table is the pre-settlement account; after selling all shares and paying the option, cash equals the net error",
 "# [trade] 仅动态策略在约定时点调仓；到期不再构造Delta": "# [trade] only the dynamic strategy rebalances at the agreed times; no Delta is rebuilt at expiry",
 "# [validation] 与网页使用同一教学域；不截断超域价格": "# [validation] the same teaching domain as the web page; out-of-domain prices are not truncated",
 "# [validation] 逐期对账与自融资验证": "# [validation] period-by-period reconciliation and self-financing checks",
 "# RStudio实践：保持N、seed与其他参数不变，只修改interval后整段重跑。": "# RStudio practice: keep N, seed and the other parameters fixed, change only interval, and rerun the whole script.",
 "# 一份教学欧式期权对应一单位标的；卖出一份，非真实市场预测": "# one teaching European option corresponds to one unit of the underlying; selling one is not a real market forecast",
 "# 比较errors和逐期账户；更频繁调仓不保证本路径误差单调下降或盈利。": "# compare errors and the period-by-period account; more frequent rebalancing does not guarantee monotonically falling error or a profit on this path.",
 "Call 看涨期权 · 价格随 S 的曲线": "Call option · price against S",
