 "RStudio实践：保持 N 和 seed 不变，只改调仓间隔，比较终值与逐期账户；观察误差绝对值不保证单调下降。": "RStudio practice: keep N and the seed fixed, change only the rebalancing interval, and compare the terminal value with the period-by-period account; watch that the absolute error is not guaranteed to fall monotonically.",
 "固定比较：共同坐标，超出时扩展；点击切换自动适配": "Fixed comparison: shared axes, extended when out of range; click to switch to auto-fit",
 "Σ的对角线是方差，非对角线是协方差。假设模式用diag(σ)ρdiag(σ)，数据模式用样本cov()；岭正则只有主动选择才加到对角线。": "The diagonal of Σ holds the variances and the off-diagonal entries the covariances. Assumption mode uses diag(σ)ρdiag(σ); data mode uses the sample cov(); ridge regularisation is added to the diagonal only when you actively select it.",
 "一份教学期权＝一单位标的": "One teaching option = one unit of the underlying",
 "上一步": "Previous step",
 "下一步": "Next step",
 "代码已复制，可在 RStudio 整体运行": "Code copied — run it end to end in RStudio",
 "价格误差": "Price error",
 "净 Delta · 单位": "Net Delta · units",
 "初始 Delta 中性": "Initially Delta-neutral",
 "初始净值 Π₀ · 元": "Initial net value Π₀ · CNY",
 "初始股价 S₀": "Initial share price S₀",
 "初始自融资账户": "Initial self-financing account",
 "协方差矩阵描述不同资产收益率之间如何共同波动，是计算组合风险的重要基础。Σ=diag(σ)ρdiag(σ)，CSV模式用样本cov()。": "The covariance matrix describes how different asset returns move together and is the basis for portfolio risk. Σ = diag(σ)ρdiag(σ); CSV mode uses the sample cov().",
 "卖出": "Sell",
 "卖方 −Δ": "Short side −Δ",
 "卖方 Delta · 单位": "Short-side Delta · units",
 "参数变化即重建路径、清除旧步骤；更改调仓间隔保留相同随机路径。": "Changing a parameter rebuilds the path and clears the old steps; changing the rebalancing interval keeps the same random path.",
 "参数用小数表示；当前权重来自已提交的完整精度状态，显示两位小数不会改变金融计算。": "Parameters are shown as decimals; the current weights come from the committed full-precision state, and showing two decimals does not change the financial calculation.",
