 "收益μp=wᵀμ；目标收益约束是等式μᵀw=r。禁止卖空时目标必须在资产预期收益最小与最大值之间；有效前沿只取GMV以上的收益。": "The return is μp = wᵀμ and the target-return constraint is the equality μᵀw = r. When short selling is banned the target must lie between the smallest and largest asset expected return; the efficient frontier takes only returns above the GMV.",
 "方差wᵀΣw包含自身风险与所有交叉协方差；开平方才得到与收益率同量纲的标准差。": "The variance wᵀΣw includes own risk and every cross-covariance; taking the square root is what gives a standard deviation on the same scale as the return.",
 "有效前沿从GMV到最高资产收益：加入目标收益等式 μᵀw=r，逐个求解最小方差。绿色曲线连接真实优化解，灰色采样不参与求解。": "The efficient frontier runs from the GMV to the highest asset return: add the target-return equation μᵀw = r and solve the minimum variance for each target. The green curve links the true optimal solutions; the grey samples do not take part in the solve.",
