 "连续时间复制理论与有限次数调仓不同；误差来自离散调仓、股息积分近似和浮点计算。现实还存在交易成本、跳跃、波动率与模型误差。任何策略均不保证盈利。": "Continuous-time replication theory differs from finitely many rebalancings; the error comes from discrete rebalancing, the dividend integral approximation and floating-point arithmetic. Reality also has transaction costs, jumps, volatility and model error. No strategy guarantees a profit.",
