 "默认\u0001期固定正弦z，在第\u0001期加冲击；\u0001倍z不是\u0001%收益。原始合成数据生成参数固定，改变拟合／教学参数不会换样本。": "The default has \u0001 periods of fixed sine z with a shock added at period \u0001; a \u0001× z is not a \u0001% return. The synthetic generating parameters are fixed, so changing fitting or teaching parameters does not resample.",
 "可复现案例 S=K=\u0001、T=\u0001、r=\u0001%、σ=\u0001%。只把连续股息收益率 q 从\u0001%调到\u0001%，Call与Put如何变化？": "Reproducible case S=K=\u0001, T=\u0001, r=\u0001%, σ=\u0001%. Moving only the continuous dividend q from \u0001% to \u0001%, how do Call and Put change?",
