 "截距 \u0001；调整R² \u0001；残差SE \u0001；残差df \u0001；F \u0001 / p \u0001e\u0001。": "Intercept \u0001; adjusted R² \u0001; residual SE \u0001; residual df \u0001; F \u0001 / p \u0001e\u0001.",
 "当前\u0001期训练，\u0001期测试，按目标日期升序。特征时间与目标时间已嵌入。CSV使用当前确认/转换/对齐后的数据，不依赖用户机器文件。频率和发布时间需用户核实。": "Currently \u0001 training and \u0001 test periods, sorted by target date. Feature and target timestamps are embedded. The CSV uses the data as confirmed, converted and aligned here and needs no file on your machine. Frequency and release times must be verified by the user.",
 "当前市场系统性风险暴露约为市场组合的\u0001倍（不是所有风险的倍数）；模型要求的预期收益率为\u0001%／年。市场溢价为正，Beta越大，必要收益越高，不保证实际收益。": "Current systematic exposure is about \u0001× the market portfolio (not a multiple of all risk); the model requires \u0001%/yr. With a positive market premium, a higher Beta means a higher required return, but no guaranteed actual return.",
